# Item Mall architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/item-mall.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/item-mall.md).

**Permanent decision:** **ARC** ≠ **AsteronCredits (AC)**. AC spends only in
the **Item Mall**. Money grants AC **only** via Stripe webhook + ledger.
Storefront categories: **Consumables**, **Outfits** (same slot tabs as
Outfitters — head/torso/arms/legs/feet/back; single pieces or multi-item
**outfit packs**), **Placeables** (AC buy → **building inventory** → place in
hab/hangar). Baseline still `consumable` only — widen `mall.rs` + Console
allowlists together.
Pay UI: [Stripe](../../docs/docs/architecture/stripe.md). Play surface:
[HaloBand](../../docs/docs/architecture/haloband.md). Operator how-to:
[Payments](../../docs/docs/server-console/payments.md).

When changing mall purchase, listings, outfit packs, placeables, credit packs,
Stripe webhook, ledger, or Commerce Console, read the full doc first. Also
listed in `AGENTS.md`.
